      "title_at_revision": "Fire extinguishing system materials",
      "text": "For commuter category aeroplanes, the following apply:\n(a) No material in any fire extinguishing system may react chemically with any extinguishing agent so as to create a hazard.\n(b) Each system component in an engine compartment must be fireproof.",
